--
libstdc++ 13 std::visit (variant line 1851) lost its body:
__gen_vtable_impl's partial specialization for _Multi_array<_Result_type
(*)(_Visitor, _Variants...)> was not matched
(cpp98_partial_specialization_compound_type_in_template_argument).  g++ 13
and clang++ 18 accept this program, and it fails only its WRONG assertion.
